WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:30.940 --> 00:01:35.970
"Encounters ~ Reunions"

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:40.350
Look, Toranosuke!

00:01:41.090 --> 00:01:45.400
New York and Tokyo are great, but Hong Kong has a force all its own.

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:47.600
Miss Kajika, it's time.

00:01:47.890 --> 00:01:51.410
Already? I'm not in the mood for a party.

00:01:51.930 --> 00:01:54.020
We mustn't be late...

00:01:54.020 --> 00:01:58.360
it's Master Lee-Leng's uncle's party. So! Please get in the car.

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:00.060
Okay, okay.

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:07.870
Kajika.

00:02:08.450 --> 00:02:09.480
Lee-Leng.

00:02:11.930 --> 00:02:13.050
Wow...

00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:16.630
Chinese clothes are definitely your best look.

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:20.940
Welcome, Kajika and Toranosuke!

00:02:21.470 --> 00:02:24.000
Let me introduce my uncle, Ken-Chang.

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:28.450
Pleased to meet you. I'm Kajika Burnsworth.

00:02:29.490 --> 00:02:31.850
This is my wife, Bridget.

00:02:32.020 --> 00:02:32.910
A pleasure.

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:38.770
Kajika, be careful... this one can be cold-blooded.

00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:43.030
There was a time when he was that attached to me.

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:44.380
Bridget.

00:02:44.610 --> 00:02:48.060
Well! Come now, you two, come in.

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:50.010
Bridget, show them around.

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:52.230
Come with me, please.

00:02:54.620 --> 00:02:56.910
Same old Bridget.

00:02:57.490 --> 00:03:01.070
Lee-Leng, I know you don't like this...

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:04.750
but Bridget is all I can think about.

00:03:05.130 --> 00:03:08.090
The kind of woman you decide to marry is up to you, Uncle.

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:12.380
However, if it looks like it's hurting the Huang family's ability to compete...

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:15.070
Got it! Nothing like that will happen.

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:17.470
I apologize for intruding...

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:23.680
but as head of the Huang, I can't overlook anything, however small.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:25.870
No, no, naturally.

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:29.520
Let's go. We mustn't keep your guests waiting...

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:36.600
Kajika, these are my husband's younger brothers and their wives.

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:38.320
Well, I'll be...

00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:44.310
the rumor is true, then, that Lee-Leng has been made bodyguard to the daughter of the Burnsworth family.

00:03:44.560 --> 00:03:47.720
What an honor for the Huang family.

00:03:47.850 --> 00:03:49.800
I'm just a chaperone...

00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:52.360
since Kajika's only a child.

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:54.990
I've told you, I'm not a child.

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:59.570
He does tend to be stubborn beyond his years.

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:01.100
You've got that right.

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:02.590
Miss Kajika--

00:04:02.690 --> 00:04:06.090
Well! Maybe now Tonsen will finally settle down.

00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:10.230
Uncle Tonsen is an important part of this family, too.

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:15.780
But when you became the leader, he opposed it to the very end.

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:17.980
He didn't even show up today.

00:04:18.170 --> 00:04:20.070
That's enough about Tonsen.

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:22.680
Lee-Leng, let me introduce you to the guests.

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:26.900
Excuse us, please, Kajika, Toranosuke.

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.580
Well, Toranosuke, it's up to you now.

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:30.550
Yes, sir.

00:04:31.490 --> 00:04:35.480
It's a happy accident that he's shown so much promise so soon.

00:04:36.470 --> 00:04:39.790
Lee-Leng is the pride of our family.

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:42.620
He's really become a fine man...

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:46.830
When his predecessor died, he was just 13...

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:51.940
Even among his family, it's amazing how much faith they put in him.

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:54.960
That's what it seems like...

00:05:03.540 --> 00:05:05.550
What happened, Kajika?

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:07.410
You don't like the party?

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:12.260
I've never been to a party like this before...

00:05:12.320 --> 00:05:14.720
but it seems like it might not be my kind of thing.

00:05:16.380 --> 00:05:19.260
That's natural, you're only 14...

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:23.960
Um.. did Lee-Leng come here often, in the old days?

00:05:24.270 --> 00:05:28.550
Yes... he stayed here for a year when he was 13.

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:31.450
Does that bother you?

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:34.970
I have something nice for you.

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:39.850
The key to the "secret garden" in the greenhouse.

00:05:40.130 --> 00:05:41.730
"Secret garden?"

00:05:42.010 --> 00:05:44.980
Yes, that's where I always used to go with Lee-Leng.

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:47.610
With Lee-Leng...?

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:49.990
That's right, would you like to see it?

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:56.010
You'll know it by the ribbon tied to the doorknob.

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:03.070
Miss Kajika?  Where did you go?

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:05.500
Miss Kajika!

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:08.230
Kajika is fine, she's with me.

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:10.740
Why don't you go enjoy the party?

00:06:10.940 --> 00:06:12.750
No, we'll stay together.

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:16.850
Well, you can't exactly follow us into the women's powder room.

00:06:17.630 --> 00:06:18.750
B--But...

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:19.990
Yes?

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:25.270
Tonsen really didn't come.

00:06:25.830 --> 00:06:29.310
It looks like he really is getting in bed with the Rosenthals.

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:31.070
Rosenthal?

00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:34.010
We've gotten word from Singapore...

00:06:34.590 --> 00:06:38.090
he intends to ally with the Rosenthals and oppose Burnsworth.

00:06:40.050 --> 00:06:42.520
But it's too late, this era belongs to Burnsworth.

00:06:43.140 --> 00:06:46.520
Naming you as bodyguard to Miss Kajika is saying, in effect...

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:50.470
that you have been chosen as her future husband.

00:06:51.490 --> 00:06:55.980
Harry Burnsworth has America... no, the world at his feet.

00:06:56.520 --> 00:07:00.080
Lee-Leng, getting this girl for the family's sake would be...

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:04.700
With Burnsworth, it's not that easy, Uncle.

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:07.330
Master Lee-Leng! We've got trouble!

00:07:08.450 --> 00:07:09.570
Miss Kajika...

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:10.980
What happened?

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:12.300
She's gone!

00:07:12.590 --> 00:07:15.300
I just took my eyes off of her for a second in the powder room...

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:17.870
Toranosuke! What were you doing?

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:21.700
Well... I couldn't exactly follow them into the bathroom...

00:07:21.780 --> 00:07:25.060
Idiot! If you have to, follow her into the bath!

00:07:25.700 --> 00:07:28.720
You search the house, I'll take the garden!

00:07:28.770 --> 00:07:29.640
Y--yes, sir!

00:07:31.170 --> 00:07:35.050
Even Lee-Leng yells sometimes... I've never seen it before.

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:39.370
Join in the search! She's practically a wild girl, raised on an island...

00:07:41.340 --> 00:07:43.390
An innocent country girl like that...

00:07:44.110 --> 00:07:47.150
will probably be easy prey for a city man.

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:51.650
Good luck, Leon.

00:07:57.780 --> 00:08:00.100
It's just a greenhouse.

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:05.210
Stupid, what was I expecting to find?

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:15.280
I just knew so little about Lee-Leng...

00:08:16.130 --> 00:08:18.380
Hey, you taking a break too?

00:08:19.170 --> 00:08:21.490
Sorry, did I startle you?

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:25.860
I'm Leon Wie. I'm a friend of Bridget's.

00:08:26.490 --> 00:08:27.830
How did you get in?

00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:31.910
The... the lock on the back door is broken.

00:08:32.260 --> 00:08:34.720
I come here sometimes to take a break from the party.

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:37.660
But hey, today is my lucky day...

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:39.880
meeting such a cute girl.

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:43.290
Hmph. Well, you go ahead and relax.

00:08:43.340 --> 00:08:45.530
--Eh?
--I'm going to go back in.

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:49.260
W--wait a moment, can't you talk for a minute?

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:51.410
But I don't know you.

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:55.280
Well, if you talk to me, you'll get to know me, won't you...

00:08:56.980 --> 00:08:58.810
Is something troubling you?

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:02.140
People who ask you to talk to them...

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:05.630
are people with troubles, according to Maria.

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:09.570
Ah... that's right. I'm troubled.

00:09:09.990 --> 00:09:11.790
Is that so? Okay, I'll listen.

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:13.940
Ah... in short...

00:09:14.270 --> 00:09:16.220
There's a girl I fell for at first sight...

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:19.200
but she doesn't care about me.

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:21.210
Hm.

00:09:21.730 --> 00:09:24.210
So... do you understand?

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:26.690
I'm talking about you...

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:29.270
Well, you'd better give up.

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:30.550
Huh?

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:34.220
My dad definitely didn't choose you.

00:09:34.780 --> 00:09:37.050
You-- what are you talking about?

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:38.650
Shut up!

00:09:39.020 --> 00:09:41.530
W--who's there? How rude-- come out here!

00:09:45.570 --> 00:09:46.770
Why is it...

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:51.380
he seems familiar, like I've missed him... but I've never seen him before...

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:54.510
What is this? You're a kid.

00:09:55.010 --> 00:09:56.970
I certainly am. But...

00:09:58.050 --> 00:10:02.170
the girl you're hitting on doesn't look any older.

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:04.550
It's fine, so get out of here!

00:10:05.590 --> 00:10:07.740
I was here first.

00:10:08.220 --> 00:10:10.490
Didn't anyone teach you to wait your turn?

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:13.290
What!?

00:10:18.820 --> 00:10:21.560
Too slow. That's no way to pick up girls.

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:24.040
Girl!

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:27.690
I'm not "girl!" I have a name; it's Kajika!

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:30.170
I'm telling you, leave.

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:34.930
Didn't anyone teach you to give your name when someone gives you theirs?

00:10:35.600 --> 00:10:36.960
I've never heard that.

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:42.550
Pretty insolent, telling me to give you my name... I'll remember that.

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:46.820
You little--!

00:10:46.820 --> 00:10:48.040
Look out!

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:53.380
Blue eyes...

00:11:03.020 --> 00:11:04.530
Stop!

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:07.140
That's enough! Don't take it any further!

00:11:08.210 --> 00:11:09.890
You're going to stop me, girl?!

00:11:09.890 --> 00:11:10.950
I am!

00:11:11.090 --> 00:11:12.190
Damn it!

00:11:15.090 --> 00:11:16.350
Stop this!

00:11:17.100 --> 00:11:18.480
Please calm yourself.

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:22.040
If you are angry, direct it at me.

00:11:23.140 --> 00:11:27.010
Please hit your servant, Quinza. Go ahead, I'm ready.

00:11:31.260 --> 00:11:32.650
Stupid.

00:11:33.660 --> 00:11:35.690
You, taking the place of this girl!

00:11:36.440 --> 00:11:37.430
Girl!

00:11:37.820 --> 00:11:39.710
Never show your face around me again!

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:41.370
This won't be forgiven!

00:11:41.780 --> 00:11:43.640
It's not "girl," it's "Kajika!"

00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:46.170
Kajika!

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:47.310
Miss Kajika!

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:48.430
Lee-Leng!

00:11:49.050 --> 00:11:50.520
What's going on here?

00:11:50.970 --> 00:11:53.670
Th--the... Prince...

00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:55.850
Oh, no...

00:11:55.850 --> 00:11:58.970
Leon! What did you do to my valued guest!

00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:01.040
Mr. Huang! That guy...

00:12:01.140 --> 00:12:02.160
Shut up!

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:05.970
Say one word, and I'll kick you out of Hong Kong!

00:12:06.460 --> 00:12:07.810
Geez...

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:12.410
Please accept my deepest apologies! I'll do anything!

00:12:13.840 --> 00:12:15.180
Uncle...

00:12:15.490 --> 00:12:18.470
Idiotic. Quinza, I'm going to my room.

00:12:19.610 --> 00:12:22.890
Thank you for the honor of your forgiveness!

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:40.900
Who was that?

00:12:41.850 --> 00:12:46.390
His companion was dressed like a native of the Kingdom of Raginei.

00:12:47.020 --> 00:12:50.390
Mm-hmm. You're familiar with Raginei?

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:52.370
Just the basics.

00:12:53.050 --> 00:12:58.400
Although it's located in Islamic Southeast Asia, it has its own religion based on the sun.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:04.120
The King is worshiped as the representative of the sun god, Ragi, and wields absolute power.

00:13:04.910 --> 00:13:11.070
And now, abundant oil and natural gas have brought great wealth to the small country.

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:16.560
It's fair to say the King is the richest individual in the world.

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:25.360
Until the crowning of the last King, the 73rd King Machaty Sheik, Raginei was an old-fashioned, undeveloped country.

00:13:26.640 --> 00:13:31.680
The Raginei that now exists is a result of Machaty's modernizing policies...

00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:38.910
and it's said that the current King, 74th King Woold, surpasses the last in active economic management.

00:13:40.370 --> 00:13:43.460
He's probably had considerable dealings with Burnsworth.

00:13:44.220 --> 00:13:47.380
I've been trying to get close to Raginei for a long time.

00:13:47.950 --> 00:13:53.360
After years of effort, the King entrusted me with his priceless jewel.

00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:56.550
It can't be... you mean that boy...

00:13:56.900 --> 00:13:59.320
The King has two sons.

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:05.240
Crown Prince Somand is now 16, but his weak constitution keeps him from leaving the country.

00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:10.010
Then the second prince, His Highness Rumaty Ivan!

00:14:11.900 --> 00:14:14.090
Please wear the holy cloth.

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:17.460
This may be another country, but it's still an insult to the Lord Ragi.

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:20.050
You're stubborn, too.

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:22.320
I don't wear the cloth anymore.

00:14:22.770 --> 00:14:23.820
Your Highness...

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:28.480
From time immemorial, Raginei has flourished under the protection of the sun god Ragi.

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:33.990
Covering your head, the closest part of you to the sun, shows respect for the Lord.

00:14:34.510 --> 00:14:36.310
Not to wear the holy cloth is heresy.

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:38.960
The holy cloth is only for show.

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:40.740
You're scaring me, Prince.

00:14:40.820 --> 00:14:44.530
Ever since your servant, Quinza, was appointed as your chamberlain...

00:14:45.210 --> 00:14:47.240
I have dedicated my life to God.

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:50.430
If you cannot grant me this favor...

00:14:53.980 --> 00:14:56.090
I'll slit my throat here and now.

00:14:56.340 --> 00:14:57.910
--Quinza!
--Brother!

00:14:57.930 --> 00:15:00.100
I don't grant you the honor of ending your life!

00:15:01.050 --> 00:15:04.910
Of course, ending your life without permission is treason to the royal family.

00:15:05.360 --> 00:15:07.020
I am more than ready.

00:15:07.120 --> 00:15:08.660
If I can warn Your Highness not to do this...

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:11.780
I will be happy to take any amount of blame.

00:15:16.750 --> 00:15:18.950
I won't let you stain this room with your blood!

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:20.770
The holy cloth, then...

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:24.890
I won't wear the whole thing! I hate it dragging everywhere!

00:15:25.760 --> 00:15:27.600
Informal style is fine.

00:15:28.330 --> 00:15:30.130
Sezun, His Highness' holy cloth...

00:15:30.300 --> 00:15:31.460
R--right.

00:15:33.330 --> 00:15:34.730
I'm going to sleep!

00:15:36.630 --> 00:15:38.310
You really scared me...

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:40.510
I thought you might really do it...

00:15:41.270 --> 00:15:42.430
I would have.

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:44.030
Brother!

00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:48.310
Since you became a chamberlain, it's only natural that you've dedicated your life to the royal family.

00:15:48.990 --> 00:15:51.520
But for something as small as wearing the holy cloth...

00:15:51.560 --> 00:15:52.700
It's not small!

00:15:53.490 --> 00:15:57.340
Not wearing the holy cloth is linked to sacrilege against the Lord Ragi.

00:15:57.780 --> 00:16:01.670
So it would make a perfect pretext to threaten the life of his Highness.

00:16:02.280 --> 00:16:06.310
Not to mention, if any wished to incite others against him, how much more dangerous would it become?

00:16:06.660 --> 00:16:07.740
But...

00:16:08.210 --> 00:16:12.750
When the Crown Prince reached the age of 15, the right of succession was permanently bestowed on him...

00:16:13.440 --> 00:16:17.350
until the last King, His Majesty Machaty, abandoned that ancient rule.

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:21.880
You realize what that means, Sezun.

00:16:23.030 --> 00:16:28.650
That's right. The right of succession does not rest solely with His Highness Somand.

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:31.430
Crown Prince Somand...

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:35.280
is afraid of our Prince Rumaty.

00:16:39.170 --> 00:16:40.660
Good girl, Lucia.

00:16:40.990 --> 00:16:44.620
You're a cute one, and you don't complain about anything I do.

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:49.220
Quinza nags, and won't give me even the slightest freedom.

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:54.900
You know what I want, Lucia? To become my brother's eyes and hands.

00:16:56.270 --> 00:16:58.710
Since my brother can't set foot outside the palace,

00:16:59.180 --> 00:17:00.540
I want to see the world for him.

00:17:01.840 --> 00:17:03.630
I have to grow up quickly...

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:06.380
then my brother's advisers won't get in our way...

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:08.740
and we'll be able to defend Raginei together...

00:17:12.020 --> 00:17:14.230
She was rude... that odd girl.

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:17.770
She actually told me to give her my name...

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:23.220
Who is he... the Orient Blue boy...

00:17:24.620 --> 00:17:26.410
Ah, I can't sleep!

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:30.140
Now, Miss Kajika... please sleep quietly tonight...

00:17:30.640 --> 00:17:33.600
I know... I know, but...

00:17:36.730 --> 00:17:40.720
I'll do it! I'll go ask Lee-Leng. I can't sleep anyway.

00:17:44.180 --> 00:17:45.730
Toranosuke's not here...

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:54.920
Ah! Orient Blue!

00:18:00.170 --> 00:18:01.260
Orient Blue!

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:03.520
That damn girl...

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:06.730
It's "Kajika," Orient Blue, I keep telling you that.

00:18:06.950 --> 00:18:09.220
What is this "Orient Blue?"

00:18:09.220 --> 00:18:10.910
It's the color of your eyes.

00:18:11.030 --> 00:18:13.110
That's what I call you since I don't know your name.

00:18:13.330 --> 00:18:15.260
Hurry and tell me!

00:18:15.340 --> 00:18:16.440
Rude girl!

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:20.080
You think I give out the honor of calling me by name as freely as you?

00:18:20.210 --> 00:18:22.630
I'm going out here, so go home!

00:18:22.860 --> 00:18:24.950
--Hmm
--What?

00:18:25.050 --> 00:18:27.620
I have a pretty loud voice...

00:18:27.910 --> 00:18:29.830
calling someone over here would be easy.

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:34.290
Tell me your name.

00:18:38.460 --> 00:18:39.780
Lee-Leng...

00:18:40.710 --> 00:18:42.200
Too bad about today.

00:18:42.540 --> 00:18:44.830
Poor Leon isn't allowed in and out anymore.

00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:49.700
A lover or two won't make much difference to you, Bridget.

00:18:49.930 --> 00:18:52.140
None of that, now. He was a friend.

00:18:52.600 --> 00:18:53.980
I don't care either way.

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:55.540
Lee-Leng...

00:18:55.690 --> 00:18:58.410
You're still stuck on things that happened a long time ago...

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:01.810
Do you think of me as a cold-hearted woman?

00:19:01.940 --> 00:19:03.860
I don't ask you to believe me...

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:07.400
but the first person I ever loved was you.

00:19:07.820 --> 00:19:10.340
But to tell my husband that I was leaving, that I felt nothing...

00:19:10.380 --> 00:19:11.920
it was impossible!

00:19:12.020 --> 00:19:13.060
Bridget...

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:16.270
the idea that you should leave my uncle...

00:19:16.450 --> 00:19:17.900
never once crossed my mind.

00:19:18.710 --> 00:19:20.200
And while we're on the subject...

00:19:20.470 --> 00:19:23.820
my uncle knew about us.

00:19:24.420 --> 00:19:25.890
Wh--what are you... saying...

00:19:26.370 --> 00:19:27.470
Bridget...

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:31.260
I just wanted to find out what women are truly like.

00:19:32.130 --> 00:19:35.960
In you, it's easy to see a woman's poisonous side...

00:19:35.960 --> 00:19:37.490
that's the only reason I picked you.

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:38.630
Lee-Leng...

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:40.490
If you can't stand my uncle, leave him...

00:19:40.850 --> 00:19:41.940
but...

00:19:41.940 --> 00:19:46.560
if you want to go on living in luxury, keep playing the role of his wife.

00:19:47.100 --> 00:19:48.980
Good night, Bridget.

00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:54.820
So, Rumaty, huh? It's a nice name.

00:19:56.690 --> 00:19:58.340
How old are you?

00:19:58.740 --> 00:20:00.830
How come I have to tell you everything?

00:20:01.120 --> 00:20:03.710
I just thought we might be around the same age.

00:20:04.460 --> 00:20:05.900
I'm 14.

00:20:06.210 --> 00:20:07.370
...me too.

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:09.320
You really are shameless.

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:12.280
Wh--what?

00:20:12.280 --> 00:20:13.540
It's strange...

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:16.940
How is it your eyes are blue?

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:19.180
Although your features are Asian...

00:20:19.310 --> 00:20:22.160
It's because my ancestor had blue eyes.

00:20:22.350 --> 00:20:24.730
Well, do the rest of your family have blue eyes?

00:20:25.020 --> 00:20:26.300
Nope, just me.

00:20:27.810 --> 00:20:30.050
The color of my eyes is my particular pride...

00:20:30.860 --> 00:20:33.300
because it's proof that I carry the blood of Samaness.

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:37.920
Samaness was the man who founded the country of Raginei. A great man!

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:39.700
Raginei?

00:20:39.930 --> 00:20:41.420
You're from Raginei?

00:20:41.990 --> 00:20:45.410
My dad does business with your country, I think.

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:47.920
Huh. An oil man...

00:20:48.490 --> 00:20:51.940
In Raginei, you have to cover your head with a cloth, right?

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:55.210
Why is yours just wrapped around like that?

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:57.690
This? This is the informal way.

00:20:58.340 --> 00:21:01.670
Quinza annoyed me into wearing it, one way or the other.

00:21:01.990 --> 00:21:03.410
The man from before?

00:21:03.410 --> 00:21:04.490
Yeah.

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:08.170
He sounds just as stubborn as Lee-Leng.

00:21:08.670 --> 00:21:10.000
Lee-Leng?

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:11.980
He's my chaperone.

00:21:12.420 --> 00:21:15.300
But... that's an important thing, isn't it?

00:21:16.330 --> 00:21:20.910
Yeah... originally, the holy cloth was a way to honor the Lord Ragi.

00:21:21.110 --> 00:21:25.880
Therefore believers would cover their heads, and, during the day, never remove the cloths in public.

00:21:26.070 --> 00:21:27.490
Never?

00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:30.810
There are two times you remove the cloth...

00:21:30.850 --> 00:21:33.940
to admit defeat, and to propose marriage.

00:21:34.550 --> 00:21:37.680
That's a lot to do for one little cloth...

00:21:38.430 --> 00:21:41.740
However, it's just an empty custom now.

00:21:42.640 --> 00:21:44.290
I hate that kind of thing.

00:21:45.120 --> 00:21:46.860
When we get obsessed with the formalities...

00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:49.400
we've lost the true nature of religion.

00:21:50.280 --> 00:21:51.790
I don't really understand...

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:53.730
but it's good to have your own opinion.

00:21:55.190 --> 00:21:57.940
But... as part of the way of dressing in your country...

00:21:58.230 --> 00:21:59.700
I like it.

00:22:00.130 --> 00:22:03.590
A long time ago, my dad showed me a picture of it.

00:22:05.610 --> 00:22:08.000
They looked like people in a fairy tale...

00:22:09.620 --> 00:22:11.890
I wanted to try wearing it, too...

00:22:13.350 --> 00:22:14.580
You want to wear it?

00:22:14.630 --> 00:22:16.030
Yes, I do!

00:22:18.480 --> 00:22:19.580
What is it?

00:22:23.140 --> 00:22:24.320
Here, take it.

00:22:26.020 --> 00:22:29.830
In the temple, the high priest prayed over this holy cloth for many days.

00:22:30.550 --> 00:22:33.060
But then, isn't this really important?

00:22:33.060 --> 00:22:34.110
I can't take this!

00:22:34.130 --> 00:22:35.580
I said you could take it!

00:22:36.270 --> 00:22:39.040
Stop making me repeat myself, rude girl!

00:22:42.350 --> 00:22:43.540
Rumaty!

00:22:44.090 --> 00:22:45.360
Dammit, are you still...

00:22:46.630 --> 00:22:48.030
Does it suit me?

00:22:57.970 --> 00:22:59.330
Kajika!

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:24.380
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
